messages:
Anya P: Quick FYI  PR #4709 needs snippet updates. We switched to async iterators for streaming and renamed pagination params. Need minimal examples (py/ts/go), a one-line migration blurb, and a retry guidance note.
Sam W: I'll update Go examples (old Chunks() -> StreamIter()). Also add a tiny pagination mapping sample.
Priya S: I'll take TS and check event->async-iterator migration plus a short note about backpressure -- show try/catch around iteration.
Mike L: Python drafts incoming: a context-manager iterator and a compact retry (capped exp backoff). Will add "don't retry on 4xx" right next to snippet.
Nina K: CI flagged a dead link to /docs/streams_old.md in the original PR. Replace with /docs/streams and use anchor #iterator-migration.
Jules R (docs-bot): Deploy preview created: https://deploy-preview-4709--docs.redwood.ai (linkcheck passed after fixes).
Sam W: Go snippet (old vs new):
```go
// old
resp,_ := client.Stream(ctx, req)
for c := range resp.Chunks() { fmt.Println(c.Text) }
// new
it := client.StreamIter(ctx, req)
for it.Next() { fmt.Println(it.Value().Text) }
```
Priya S: TS snippet:
```ts
// old
const s = client.stream(req)
s.on('data', c => console.log(c.text))
// new
try {
  for await (const chunk of client.streamIter(req)) {
    console.log(chunk.text)
  }
} catch (e) { /* handle transient vs client errors */ }
```
Mike L: Py snippet + tiny retry:
```py
from time import sleep

def tiny_retry(fn, tries=3):
  for i in range(tries):
    try: return fn()
    except TransientError:
      sleep(min(2**i, 5))
  raise

with client.stream_iter(prompt) as it:
  for chunk in it:
    print(chunk.text)
# note: do not retry on 4xx errors
```
Anya P: Also add one-liner migration mapping: "page -> page_token; per_page -> page_size; responses include next_page_token." Keep snippets tiny and copy-paste friendly. I'll merge if preview stays green in ~1h. :rocket:
